Package: ganbs.toolkit.demo
Title: Demo Toolkit for Newborn Screening Epidemiology Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Erin", "LaFon", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A portfolio demonstration package showing reusable R functions
    for newborn screening (NBS) epidemiology reporting, including specimen
    trend analysis and county-level choropleth mapping. Built with fully
    synthetic example data - no real surveillance data is included.
